message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "Exact Gaussian mixing on bipartite cycle tori"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Computes separate sharp theta and total-variation profiles for Gaussian modular distributions on the bipartite cycle-lattice torus, including arbitrary diverging aspect ratios and the critical endpoint. This is a probability theorem, not a statement about a cryptosystem."
